# Only api/ and ui/ are used by ops/containers/Dockerfile; keep everything else
# out of the build context so it uploads quickly.
*
!api/
!ui/

# Host builds and native binaries from macOS won't run in the Linux image
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.tmp

# Secrets and local config
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
api/config/local*
api/config/test*

# Not needed in images
api/tests
**/*.md
**/*.MD
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea
